@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@accessToken =
@adminToken =
@apiSportsKey =
@date = 2026-10-02
@mlbEventId = REEMPLAZAR_UUID_INTERNO

### Catálogo y cuatro mercados MLB
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Jornada UTC; filtra MLB y comparte caché diez minutos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/events?sport=MLB&date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Juego completo, incluidas entradas extra
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{mlbEventId}}","market":"MONEYLINE","selection":"HOME"}

### Run Line local -1.5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{mlbEventId}}","market":"SPREAD","selection":"HOME","line":-1.5}

### Total de carreras
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{mlbEventId}}","market":"TOTAL","selection":"OVER","line":7.5}

### Carreras del equipo visitante
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{mlbEventId}}","market":"TEAM_TOTAL","selection":"OVER","line":2.5,"team":"AWAY"}

### Seguimientos guardados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Capacidad ausente: 503 MLB_PLAYER_DATA_UNAVAILABLE; no consume proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/events/{{mlbEventId}}/players
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Diagnóstico local MLB
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/provider?sport=MLB
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Comprobar cuenta con API-Baseball
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/provider/check?sport=MLB
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Proveedor crudo; ejecutar consume cuota
GET https://v1.baseball.api-sports.io/games?date={{date}}&timezone=UTC
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### Status; no publicar datos personales de la cuenta
GET https://v1.baseball.api-sports.io/status
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}
